          'At OutBrick the core game is solitary, so the social part lives around the board. The [daily board](/daily) gives everyone the same puzzle on the same day, wherever they are, and you can send your stars to a friend without giving the answer away. If you are looking for gentler ways to play with people, our guide to [friendly competition without the pressure](/blog/friendly-competition-with-friends) picks up where this leaves off.',
